<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-11-19T06:00:00.000Z" agent="Hermes Agent (Executive Design System)" version="24.7.17" type="device"><diagram id="e2e-sovereign-ai-arch" name="端到端生命週期與五層系統架構全景拓撲"><mxGraphModel dx="2560" dy="1440" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2560" pageHeight="1440" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; width:100%; height:100%; color:#FFFFFF; padding:0 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.5px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;⚡ 企業級主權 AI 平台：端到端使用者調用流程與五層系統架構全景拓撲&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px; color:#94A3B8; margin-top:4px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;左右雙欄對稱架構：左側「8 階段端到端使用者調用生命週期」 × 右側「5 層企業全景架構拓撲」• 成本節省 73.8% • 延遲降低 42%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; gap:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#1E293B; border:1px solid #334155; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:6px; font-size:12px; color:#38BDF8; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;架構負責人：Howard Liao Ph.D.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#065F46; border:1px solid #059669; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:6px; font-size:12px; color:#A7F3D0; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;主權自研專案：鬥陣江湖 / SX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#1E293B;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2480" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:14px 18px; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#4F46E5; color:white; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px; text-transform:uppercase;&quot;&gt;User Journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; margin-left:10px;&quot;&gt;左側：使用者端到端請求生命週期與處理管線&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;float:right; font-size:12px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;8 大階段全鏈路深入解析&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;startSize=46;horizontal=1;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=0;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="1160" height="1290" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#DBEAFE; color:#2563EB; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #BFDBFE;&quot;&gt;終端輸入&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 01. 終端業務調用發起 (User Prompt &amp; API Ingress)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#3B82F6;&quot;&gt;階段 01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;業務人員於 Web Portal 輸入、研發於 IDE 插件觸發，或智慧產線 MES / ERP 系統發起自動推論請求&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;標準協議:&lt;/b&gt; /v1/chat/completions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;身分憑證:&lt;/b&gt; SSO JWT Token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;上下文注入:&lt;/b&gt; RAG Prompt &amp; Context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;發起方式:&lt;/b&gt; 流式 (SSE) / 批次 (REST)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #3B82F6;&quot;&gt;嚴格遵循 OpenAI 兼容接口，自帶企業部門 Code 與 RBAC 角色宣告，支援代碼補全與多輪對話&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F0F7FF;strokeColor=#BFDBFE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="170" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#FEF3C7; color:#D97706; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #FDE68A;&quot;&gt;邊界安全&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 02. 邊界安全與零信任鑑權 (Zero-Trust Perimeter &amp; Ingress)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#D97706;&quot;&gt;階段 02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;Envoy Gateway 實施雙向 mTLS 終結，Keycloak 驗證 JWT 簽章與過期時間，WAF 深度過濾惡意 Payload&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;傳輸加密:&lt;/b&gt; TLS 1.3 mTLS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;鑑權驗證:&lt;/b&gt; Keycloak OAuth2 / RBAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;安全防護:&lt;/b&gt; WAF 防 Prompt Injection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;流量整形:&lt;/b&gt; Token-Bucket Rate Limiter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #D97706;&quot;&gt;阻絕外部惡意嗅探與越權調用，防範 Prompt Leaking 與越獄攻擊 (Jailbreaking)，保護內網核心&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FDE68A;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="313" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#D1FAE5; color:#059669; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #A7F3D0;&quot;&gt;語意快取&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 03. 語意向量快取比對 (Semantic Vector Cache Lookup)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#059669;&quot;&gt;階段 03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;輕量 Embedding 計算 Prompt 語意向量，於 Redis Vector 向量庫中檢索歷史問答餘弦相似度 (Cosine Similarity)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;快取引擎:&lt;/b&gt; Redis Vector DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;相似度判定:&lt;/b&gt; Cosine Sim &gt; 0.95&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;極速響應:&lt;/b&gt; 延遲 &lt; 10ms (Hit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;算力成本:&lt;/b&gt; $0 消耗 / 100% 節省&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #059669;&quot;&gt;⚡ 命中分支：若相似度超過 0.95 判定為高頻重複問題，直接短路回傳快取答案，繞過後續所有大模型推理&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="456" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#CFFAFE; color:#0891B2; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #A5F3FC;&quot;&gt;意圖分類&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 04. 語意意圖分類與難度打分 (Lightweight Intent Scorer)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#0891B2;&quot;&gt;階段 04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;若快取未命中，輸入進入輕量 Fine-tuned BERT 分類器 (&lt;15ms)，提取語意維度並計算複雜度得分&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;評估引擎:&lt;/b&gt; Fine-tuned BERT (&lt;15ms)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;複雜度評分:&lt;/b&gt; Score: 0.0 ~ 1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;決策閾值:&lt;/b&gt; 難題閥值 Tau = 0.65&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;分類維度:&lt;/b&gt; 常規問答 / 代碼推理 / 數學邏輯&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #0891B2;&quot;&gt;Score &lt;= 0.65 標註為常規任務（轉向地端私有算力）；Score &gt; 0.65 標註為複雜難題（轉向旗艦雲端大模型）&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECFEFF;strokeColor=#A5F3FC;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="599" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFE4E6; color:#E11D48; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #FECDD3;&quot;&gt;機密脫敏&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 05. 專利機密與 PII 動態脫敏 (Enterprise DLP Sanitizer)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#E11D48;&quot;&gt;階段 05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;針對外部調用執行專利圖號、客戶姓名、機密製程參數之在地動態遮罩，建立記憶體對稱還原字典&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DLP 引擎:&lt;/b&gt; Microsoft Presidio + 在地 NER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;敏感實體:&lt;/b&gt; 專利代碼 / 內部 IP / 客戶 PII&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;遮罩機制:&lt;/b&gt; 動態 Token 雜湊替換&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;主權保障:&lt;/b&gt; 機密明文 100% 絕不出廠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #E11D48;&quot;&gt;將例如「鬥陣江湖核心演算法 v2」替換為「TOKEN_PROPRIETARY_01」，實體對應映射表僅保存在地端記憶體 Session&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#FECDD3;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="742" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#EDE9FE; color:#7C3AED; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #DDD6FE;&quot;&gt;雙軌分流&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 06. 雙軌混合算力智能分發 (Dual-Track Model Dispatcher)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#7C3AED;&quot;&gt;階段 06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;依據意圖評分、脫敏標記與即時雲端/地端健康度，實施高性價比、高主權之動態非對稱調度：&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;軌道 A (70% 負載):&lt;/b&gt; 私有地端 K8s vLLM (Llama-3-70B / Qwen 2.5) 零公網外洩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;軌道 B (30% 難題):&lt;/b&gt; 專線直連 AWS Bedrock (Claude 3.5 Sonnet) / GCP Vertex AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;軌道 C (市場備援):&lt;/b&gt; OpenRouter (openrouter/auto) 動態比價 / SLA 容錯轉發&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #7C3AED;&quot;&gt;70% 日常任務在地端低成本消化；30% 攻堅任務脫敏後上雲；若雲端超時或斷網，自動降級熔斷回地端叢集&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#DDD6FE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="885" width="1120" height="132" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFEDD5; color:#EA580C; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #FED7AA;&quot;&gt;安全還原&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 07. 安全護欄檢測與實體逆向還原 (Guardrails &amp; De-anonymization)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#EA580C;&quot;&gt;階段 07&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;接收模型推論結果，經 Llama Guard 3 安全過濾，並藉由 Session 映射表將遮罩 Token 逆向還原為真實機密內容&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;內容審查:&lt;/b&gt; Llama Guard 3 幻覺 / 有害性檢測&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;實體還原:&lt;/b&gt; In-Memory Session 逆向映射&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;快取非同步回寫:&lt;/b&gt; Redis Vector 向量預熱&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;合規標籤:&lt;/b&gt; 注入資料主權追蹤碼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #EA580C;&quot;&gt;將「TOKEN_PROPRIETARY_01」精準還原為「鬥陣江湖核心演算法 v2」，並剔除有害或格式異常輸出&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#FED7AA;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1035" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding:12px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;div&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;background:#DCFCE7; color:#16A34A; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:8px; border:1px solid #BBF7D0;&quot;&gt;流式交付&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;步驟 08. 流式響應交付與 FinOps 遙測稽核 (SSE Delivery &amp; Telemetry)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#16A34A;&quot;&gt;階段 08&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; color:#475569; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;以 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 逐字打字機流暢回應用戶終端，同步將完整遙測數據異步寫入 Kafka 與 ClickHouse&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;傳輸形式:&lt;/b&gt; SSE (Server-Sent Events) 打字機流&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;遙測採集:&lt;/b&gt; OpenTelemetry (TTFT / Latency)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;成本結算:&lt;/b&gt; 即時 Token 費用分攤&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; color:#334155; font-size:11px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;安全存證:&lt;/b&gt; ClickHouse / ELK 脫敏日誌&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid #16A34A;&quot;&gt;🎉 最終產出：業務解答 / 代碼產出 / 產線 MES 控制指令（總延遲下降 42%、TCO 雲端支出直降 73.8%）&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#BBF7D0;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1178" width="1120" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="4" target="5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="5" target="6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="6" target="7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="7" target="8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="8" target="9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="9" target="10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="10" target="11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="⚡ 快取命中直通 (&lt;10ms 零算力成本)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeFactor=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ECFDF5;fontColor=#065F46;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="6" target="11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:14px 18px; border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0D9488; color:white; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px; text-transform:uppercase;&quot;&gt;System Topology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; margin-left:10px;&quot;&gt;右側：企業完整五層系統實體架構拓撲 (Full-Stack 5-Tier Blueprint)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;float:right; font-size:12px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;雲地混合協同 • 主權算力樞紐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;startSize=46;horizontal=1;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=0;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="110" width="1280" height="1290" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 14px; background:#F1F5F9; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; font-weight:800; color:#1E293B; font-size:13px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;📱 Tier 1: 終端展示與客戶端整合層 (Client &amp; Presentation Layer) &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400; color:#64748B; font-size:11px; margin-left:10px;&quot;&gt;全渠道業務接入 / 多終端適配&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=34;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="170" width="1240" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;企業內部 Web Portal&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#3B82F6; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;React 19 / Next.js / Tailwind&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;多輪對話 / 文件問答 / 專利審閱&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1275" y="212" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;智慧產線 MES / ERP 終端&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#0284C7; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;C# / Python API Agent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;即時良率告警 / 設備日誌摘要&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1577" y="212" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;研發工程師 IDE 插件&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#4F46E5; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;VSCode / JetBrains Extension&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;程式碼自動生成 / 程式碼審查&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1879" y="212" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;企業統一內部 AI SDK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#6366F1; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Python / TypeScript Client&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;標準化調用庫 / 內建斷線重試&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2181" y="212" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 14px; background:#FEF3C7; border-bottom:1px solid #FCD34D; font-weight:800; color:#92400E; font-size:13px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🛡️ Tier 2: 安全邊界防禦與入口閘道層 (Security Perimeter &amp; Ingress DMZ) &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400; color:#B45309; font-size:11px; margin-left:10px;&quot;&gt;零信任邊界 / TLS 1.3 終結 / WAF 流量清洗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=34;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FCD34D;strokeWidth=1.2;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="315" width="1240" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;Envoy API Gateway&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#D97706; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Envoy / NGINX Plus&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;雙向 mTLS 終結 / 負載均衡 / 限流&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FDE68A;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1275" y="357" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:800; color:#0F172A; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;企業 SSO 統一鑑權中心&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#B45309; margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Keycloak / OAuth2.0 &amp; OIDC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;JWT 簽發與校驗 / 部門 RBAC 授權&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FDE68A;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1577" y="357" width="292" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&